README.md:49:Super Mode | Inspired by [n2n](https://github.com/ntop/n2n). There 2 types of node: SuperNode and EdgeNode. The SuperNode runs an HTTP-only control service (Control API v2) with HMAC-signed requests, SSE event streaming, and ETag polling. No UDP listener, no WireGuard keys, no UAPI on the Super side.<br>[Detail](example_config/super_mode/README.md)
README.md:67:apt-get install -y wireguard-tools golang-go build-essential git
README_zh.md:50:Super Mode | 此模式是受到[n2n](https://github.com/ntop/n2n)的啟發，分為SuperNode和EdgeNode兩種節點。SuperNode運行純HTTP控制服務（Control API v2），支援HMAC簽名請求、SSE事件串流和ETag輪詢。Super端無UDP listener、無WireGuard金鑰、無UAPI。<br>[詳細介紹](example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md)
README_zh.md:68:apt-get install -y wireguard-tools golang-go build-essential git
example_config/super_mode/README.md:4:## Super mode (HTTP-only Control API v2)
example_config/super_mode/README.md:9:**Breaking change:** Super mode no longer uses a UDP listener, WireGuard private keys, UAPI, or the `wg` command on the Super side. If you have an existing v1 config with `PrivKeyV4`, `PrivKeyV6`, `ListenPort`, `FwMark`, or `API_Prefix`, it will be rejected with a `legacy_udp_field` error. You must migrate to a v2 `SuperConfigV2` YAML before upgrading.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:21:The generator creates a v2 Super YAML and per-Edge YAML files with fresh per-Edge ControlPSKeys. Each Edge gets its own unique HMAC signing key, which appears only in that Edge's config and the matching Super peer entry.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:29:The SuperNode listens on two TCP ports (Edge API and Management API). No UDP socket is created. If you pass a legacy v1 YAML file, the process exits immediately with:
example_config/super_mode/README.md:32:control v2: legacy_udp_field: "PrivKeyV4" is no longer accepted in -mode super; use a v2 SuperConfigV2 YAML
example_config/super_mode/README.md:60:5. Edges subscribe to `GET /edge/v2/events` (SSE stream) or poll `GET /edge/v2/snapshot` to detect changes.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:63:### Control API v2 routes
example_config/super_mode/README.md:72:| GET | `/edge/v2/events` | SSE stream of state-change events |
example_config/super_mode/README.md:74:### HMAC request signing
example_config/super_mode/README.md:76:Every Control API v2 request carries four headers:
example_config/super_mode/README.md:83:| `X-EG-Signature` | `hex(HMAC-SHA256(key=ControlPSKey, msg=canonical))` |
example_config/super_mode/README.md:94:### TLS via reverse proxy
example_config/super_mode/README.md:96:The HMAC signature authenticates but does not encrypt. In production, you **must** run a reverse proxy (nginx, Caddy, etc.) in front of the SuperNode to provide TLS. The SuperNode itself only speaks HTTP.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:116:### SSE with polling fallback
example_config/super_mode/README.md:126:A dedicated polling goroutine runs alongside SSE, fetching `/edge/v2/snapshot` at `PollIntervalSeconds`. This ensures progress even when SSE is down. The Edge uses ETag/304 conditional requests to avoid transferring unchanged snapshots.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:130:The Super distributes STUN servers to all Edges via the `STUNServers` field in the parameters stream. Each Edge uses its existing WireGuard bind socket (same port as its UDP data path) to perform STUN binding requests. The XOR-MAPPED address becomes a `stun` candidate.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:132:**Same-socket limitation:** STUN candidates are measured from the WireGuard bind. If a STUN server sees a different source port than the WireGuard socket, the candidate is invalid because the NAT mapping is port-specific. Edges do not create a second UDP socket for STUN.
example_config/super_mode/README.md:153:| PollIntervalSeconds | Edge polling interval for snapshot |
example_config/super_mode/README.md:156:| EventReplay | SSE replay ring depth (default 256) |
example_config/super_mode/README.md:168:| ControlPSKey | Per-Edge HMAC signing secret (never exposed to other Edges) |
example_config/super_mode/README.md:184:| ControlPSKey | This Edge's HMAC signing secret (must match Super's peer entry) |
example_config/super_mode/README.md:190:## V1 config migration
example_config/super_mode/README.md:192:If you run `-mode super` with an old v1 config, you will see:
example_config/super_mode/README.md:195:Error: control v2: legacy_udp_field: "PrivKeyV4" is no longer accepted in -mode super
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:4:## Super Mode（HTTP-only Control API v2）
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:9:**重大變更：** Super模式不再使用UDP listener、WireGuard私鑰、UAPI或`wg`命令。如果你有舊版v1設定檔包含`PrivKeyV4`、`PrivKeyV6`、`ListenPort`、`FwMark`或`API_Prefix`，會收到`legacy_udp_field`錯誤。升級前必須遷移到v2 `SuperConfigV2` YAML。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:21:產生器會建立v2 Super YAML和每個Edge的YAML，每個Edge都有獨立的ControlPSKey。每個Edge的HMAC簽名金鑰只出現在該Edge的設定檔和Super對應的peer entry中。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:29:SuperNode監聽兩個TCP埠（Edge API和Management API）。不會建立UDP socket。如果傳入舊版v1設定檔，程式會立即退出：
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:32:control v2: legacy_udp_field: "PrivKeyV4" is no longer accepted in -mode super; use a v2 SuperConfigV2 YAML
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:60:5. Edge訂閱`GET /edge/v2/events`（SSE串流）或輪詢`GET /edge/v2/snapshot`來偵測變化。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:63:### Control API v2 路由
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:72:| GET | `/edge/v2/events` | SSE串流，推送狀態變更事件 |
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:74:### HMAC請求簽名
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:76:每個Control API v2請求攜帶四個header：
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:83:| `X-EG-Signature` | `hex(HMAC-SHA256(key=ControlPSKey, msg=canonical))` |
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:94:### 透過反向代理提供TLS
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:96:HMAC簽名進行身份驗證但不加密。在生產環境中，你**必須**在SuperNode前面部署反向代理（nginx、Caddy等）來提供TLS。SuperNode本身只提供HTTP服務。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:116:### SSE與輪詢回退
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:126:專門的輪詢goroutine與SSE並行運行，以`PollIntervalSeconds`的間隔取得`/edge/v2/snapshot`。這確保即使SSE中斷時仍有進展。Edge使用ETag/304條件請求來避免傳輸未變更的snapshot。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:130:Super透過參數串流中的`STUNServers`欄位將STUN伺服器分配給所有Edge。每個Edge使用現有的WireGuard bind socket（與UDP資料路徑相同的port）執行STUN binding請求。XOR-MAPPED位址成為`stun`候選位址。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:132:**同socket限制：** STUN候選位址是從WireGuard bind socket量測的。如果STUN伺服器看到的source port與WireGuard socket不同，該候選位址無效，因為NAT mapping是基於port的。Edge不會為STUN建立第二個UDP socket。
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:153:| PollIntervalSeconds | Edge輪詢snapshot的間隔 |
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:156:| EventReplay | SSE回放ring depth（預設256） |
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:168:| ControlPSKey | 該Edge的HMAC簽名密鑰（不會暴露給其他Edge） |
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:184:| ControlPSKey | 此Edge的HMAC簽名密鑰（必須與Super的peer entry一致） |
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:190:## v1設定檔遷移
example_config/super_mode/README_zh.md:192:如果使用舊版v1設定執行`-mode super`，會看到：
